From 96d15a2ad7ace0d93099cef7db94a14ad6a4e39d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: virtualAxe <virtualaxe@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 12:37:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] virtual: guard submit boundary with work generations

Why: prevent stale virtual work from crossing the upstream submit boundary after
clean jobs or descriptor replacement.
Virtual-only: generation checks and candidate filters are active for the virtual
ASIC path while asic_result_task still revalidates with test_nonce_value.
Upstream surface: ASIC result descriptors, virtual ASIC work generation, Stratum
clean-job handling, and mining tests.
Verify: run verify-test-ci, make verify-submit-replay, and remote-pool smoke.
Removal impact: stale virtual shares can reach submit handling after the pool has
invalidated the work.
